posts.body:
@ATT_Turan
, thankyou, I corrected it.
@SGHarlekin
I don't know for sure if it's something I'd have to pay for, but I'm more than willing to if I have to.  That all depends on how difficult each problem actually is (which admittedly I don't actually know myself, only a very rough idea)
I've certainly run into situations where I posted my problem and made a small custom script that fixed it not just for free, but told me I didn't even need to credit them (I did anyways, of course).
Also- frankly, I'm not sure what you mean by "classifieds" in the context of the RM forums, but I could poke around and see.  I don't think anything here needs to be hidden from the public though, and anyone is welcome to make use of any script I would commission, assuming that's alright with the person who made it as well.
